{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05502","headline":"和荐福寺英公新构禅堂 · 丁仙芝","name":"和荐福寺英公新构禅堂","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"上人久弃世，中道自忘筌。\n寂照出羣有，了心清衆缘。\n所以於此地，筑馆开青莲。\n果药罗砌下，烟虹垂户前。\n咒中洒甘露，指处流香泉。\n禅远目无事，体清宵不眠。\n枳闻庐山法，松入汉阳禅。\n一枕西山外，虚舟常浩然。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"丁仙芝","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05502.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05502","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}